        "atSection", "[", "\"\<3. Masks: padding and causal\>\"", "]"}], ";", 
        "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{
        "atText", 
         "[", "\"\<A mask is added to the scores before the softmax: 0 where \
attention is allowed, a very large negative number where it is not, so those \
weights become 0. A padding mask hides the padding at the end of short \
sequences. A causal mask stops position i of the decoder from seeing \
positions after i, so that it cannot read the word it is asked to predict \
(Section 3.2.3).\>\"", "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"atShow", "[", 
